## I. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

This week's monitoring identified **two after-hours access incidents** involving production systems and sensitive financial data repositories, presenting immediate insider threat and access control compliance risks under ISO 27001 A.5.15 and NIS2 continuous monitoring requirements. While no users exceeded statistical thresholds for system access volume, the after-hours activity patterns require immediate investigation to demonstrate adequate logical access controls. **Immediate action is required** to validate business justification and strengthen time-based access restrictions on critical assets.

